# DOT & DASH: a route test for the whole micro world. Every run of exposed
# ground in the lumber room and between the walls holds a micro strip; for
# each (136 in the room, 26 in the walls) the strip is built as a player
# would find it and every treasure, thing, person and speck of ground in it
# is checked reachable on foot from the way in, with the game's physics.
game dotdash
wait 5
cheat newgame
cheat verify_area 0 0
expect verify_runs >= 130
expect verify_bad == 0
cheat verify_area 2 0
expect verify_runs >= 20
expect verify_bad == 0
